Shaam E Gham Shaam E Alam<br>
shaam E Ghareeba Zainab<br>
<br>
baad E Ashur Kaha Be Sar O Samaan Zainab<br>
<br>
01-koi Batlaata Nahi Baali Sakina Hai Kahaan<br>
dhundti Phirti Hai Maqtal Me Pareshan Zainab<br>
<br>
02-jisne Beto Ke Janazoun Pe Kiya Shukr E Khuda<br>
dono Aalam Me Nahi Aisi Koi Maa Zainab<br>
<br>
03- Ab Na Akbar Hai Na Qasim Hai Na Abbas E Jari<br>
hai Nigahbaane Haram Shaam E Ghareeba Zainab<br>
<br>
04- Bekasi Dekhke Bhai Ki Sare Karbobala<br>
kisse Faryaad Kare Muztar O Hairaan Zainab<br>
<br>
05- Bekasi Aur Sakina Ki Judaai Ka Alam<br>
khoon Rulayega Tujhe Shaam Ka Zindaan Zainab<br>
<br>
06- Jaane Zahra O Ali Maqsad E Sarwar Ki Ameen<br>
waaris E Deen E Khuda Waaris E Quraan Zainab<br>
<br>
07-karbala Aaj Bhi Bhuli Nahi Manzar Wo Fareed<br>
asr E Ashur Wo Maqtal Wo Pareshan Zainab<br>
<br>
